{"server":"cn","storyId":"act13d5_level_act13d5_06_end","groupId":"act13d5","stageId":"act13d5_06","title":"蓝耳酒窖","storyCode":"MN-6","avgTag":"行动后","sourcePath":"vendor/ArknightsGamedata/cn/gamedata/story/activities/act13d5/level_act13d5_06_end.txt","sourceHash":"77d291bde129ed74a3bffd9bc595151b89cad2fb34d02af1dcb241685d44bd01","bodyAvailable":true,"summaryText":"佐菲娅久违地来到酒吧，得知玛莉娅的对手后大感惊讶——同时，左手骑士无匹的实力令玛莉娅陷入绝境。","blocks":[{"type":"narration","text":"卡西米尔 6下"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_kxstreet"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"发言人恰尔内","speakerId":"avg_npc_106","isRemote":false,"text":"前一任白金大位对目标暗生情愫，为了保护他的意中人而死在了其他无胄盟成员的手上。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"发言人恰尔内","speakerId":"avg_npc_106","isRemote":false,"text":"结果而言，如今的这位小姑娘被匆匆推上了这个位置，“最年轻的白金”。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"发言人恰尔内","speakerId":"avg_npc_106","isRemote":false,"text":"......虽然的确是天才般的射手，真要论实力倒也不至于才不配位......不过其他方面远不如其他大位成熟。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"企业员工","speakerId":"avg_npc_109","isRemote":false,"text":"是、是这样......您为什么要和我说这些？无胄盟的存在应该是个机密......您该不会......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"发言人恰尔内","speakerId":"avg_npc_106","isRemote":false,"text":"哦，别这么想，只是我最近时常在回想这件事。如果我没有努力到今天这个位置，我连思考这件事的权力都没有。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"发言人恰尔内","speakerId":"avg_npc_106","isRemote":false,"text":"你知道吗？最后推举如今的白金成为白金的，正是濒死前的上一任白金。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"发言人恰尔内","speakerId":"avg_npc_106","isRemote":false,"text":"这就很耐人寻味了......且不说为什么无胄盟要听一个叛徒的话，何况推举这个小姑娘也改变不了他的死局，他为什么要这么做？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"发言人恰尔内","speakerId":"avg_npc_106","isRemote":false,"text":"在他被同僚的弓箭贯穿胸膛之前，他是不是想过要嘶吼什么呢？对谁？说什么？他想做到什么？只是那么简单吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"企业员工","speakerId":"avg_npc_109","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"发言人恰尔内","speakerId":"avg_npc_106","isRemote":false,"text":"我记得您是斯沃玛公司的员工，对吧？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"企业员工","speakerId":"avg_npc_109","isRemote":false,"text":"是、是的......赛事期间，我负责和其他各大公司以及骑士协会交接任务......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"发言人恰尔内","speakerId":"avg_npc_106","isRemote":false,"text":"跑腿活，很辛苦。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"企业员工","speakerId":"avg_npc_109","isRemote":false,"text":"没有的事，能为企业做出贡献，是我应该做的——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"发言人恰尔内","speakerId":"avg_npc_106","isRemote":false,"text":"不不不，你的工作是为你的薪水准备的，别说这么卑微的话。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"发言人恰尔内","speakerId":"avg_npc_106","isRemote":false,"text":"你曾经似乎有过创业的记录，为什么没有坚持到底呢？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"企业员工","speakerId":"avg_npc_109","isRemote":false,"text":"啊......那是因为我能力不足......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"发言人恰尔内","speakerId":"avg_npc_106","isRemote":false,"text":"决定成败的也许不只是能力。你可能选错了路，否则你也许会和我平起平坐。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"企业员工","speakerId":"avg_npc_109","isRemote":false,"text":"就、就我这种人......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"发言人恰尔内","speakerId":"avg_npc_106","isRemote":false,"text":"在卡西米尔，皆有可能。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_sportsbar"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"佐菲娅","speakerId":"avg_npc_064_weapon_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"光头马丁","speakerId":"avg_npc_107","isRemote":false,"text":"佐菲娅......很久没看见过你了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"佐菲娅","speakerId":"avg_npc_064_weapon_1","isRemote":false,"text":"马丁叔......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"佐菲娅","speakerId":"avg_npc_064_weapon_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......玛莉娅她来过吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"光头马丁","speakerId":"avg_npc_107","isRemote":false,"text":"出了点事情，我们让她回家里去了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"佐菲娅","speakerId":"avg_npc_064_weapon_1","isRemote":false,"text":"是这样——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"佐菲娅","speakerId":"avg_npc_064_weapon_1","isRemote":false,"text":"——有血的味道，等等，这些绷带是怎么回事？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"佐菲娅","speakerId":"avg_npc_064_weapon_1","isRemote":false,"text":"玛利亚受伤了？她的对手是谁？发生了什么！？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"佐菲娅","speakerId":"avg_npc_064_weapon_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我都让她不要急着继续参赛，这个丫头怎么就——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"光头马丁","speakerId":"avg_npc_107","isRemote":false,"text":"冷静点，受伤的是另一个孩子。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"佐菲娅","speakerId":"avg_npc_064_weapon_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......怎么回事？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"光头马丁","speakerId":"avg_npc_107","isRemote":false,"text":"灰毫骑士和焰尾骑士遭到了某些人的袭击......灰毫负了伤，她们恰好躲避到了这里。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"光头马丁","speakerId":"avg_npc_107","isRemote":false,"text":"今天早上，她们说着不想再给临光添麻烦之类的话就离开了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"佐菲娅","speakerId":"avg_npc_064_weapon_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......会有这么巧的事情吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"光头马丁","speakerId":"avg_npc_107","isRemote":false,"text":"她们的处境很危险，但我们爱莫能助。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"光头马丁","speakerId":"avg_npc_107","isRemote":false,"text":"看了今早上的新闻了吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"佐菲娅","speakerId":"avg_npc_064_weapon_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"佐菲娅","speakerId":"avg_npc_064_weapon_1","isRemote":false,"text":"玛莉娅现在在做什么？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"光头马丁","speakerId":"avg_npc_107","isRemote":false,"text":"比赛。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"佐菲娅","speakerId":"avg_npc_064_weapon_1","isRemote":false,"text":"什么比赛？对手是谁？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"光头马丁","speakerId":"avg_npc_107","isRemote":false,"text":"和英格拉一样的无保护一对一，单挑赛。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"光头马丁","speakerId":"avg_npc_107","isRemote":false,"text":"对手是“左手”泰特斯·白杨。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"佐菲娅","speakerId":"avg_npc_064_weapon_1","isRemote":false,"text":"等等——谁？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"光头马丁","speakerId":"avg_npc_107","isRemote":false,"text":"锋盔骑士团主将，贵族骑士，高级商业骑士，曾到十六强止步的竞技骑士，泰特斯·白杨。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"佐菲娅","speakerId":"avg_npc_064_weapon_1","isRemote":false,"text":"可.....可是玛莉娅这个积分段无论如何也不会和他匹配到一起啊，他的身价甚至......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"光头马丁","speakerId":"avg_npc_107","isRemote":false,"text":"有人来找过玛莉娅，不是什么善茬。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"光头马丁","speakerId":"avg_npc_107","isRemote":false,"text":"现在的她就像是过去的玛嘉烈一样，一门心思往前冲，她可不懂怎么和企业家们打交道。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"佐菲娅","speakerId":"avg_npc_064_weapon_1","isRemote":false,"text":"她......她和玛嘉烈一样吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"佐菲娅","speakerId":"avg_npc_064_weapon_1","isRemote":false,"text":"玛嘉烈知道自己在做什么，她只是一厢情愿地笃定了自己的理想才变成那样的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"佐菲娅","speakerId":"avg_npc_064_weapon_1","isRemote":false,"text":"玛莉娅她都不清楚自己面对的是什么，也不知道该怎么做。再这样往上爬，实在是太危险了！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"佐菲娅","speakerId":"avg_npc_064_weapon_1","isRemote":false,"text":"至少玛莉娅本来可以过上更轻松的生活......她不用变成你我这样的竞技骑士，不是吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"光头马丁","speakerId":"avg_npc_107","isRemote":false,"text":"也许你说的对，但是她是不是有自己的觉悟，你不该妄下判断。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"光头马丁","speakerId":"avg_npc_107","isRemote":false,"text":"她还很年轻，也很不安，她那副轻松的态度也许都只是为了让你安心。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"佐菲娅","speakerId":"avg_npc_064_weapon_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"光头马丁","speakerId":"avg_npc_107","isRemote":false,"text":"虽然玛莉娅经常表现出不成熟的样子，但是哪一个没有斗志的人能够战胜塑料骑士，能和锈铜打成平手，还能在混战赛上夺得第三？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"佐菲娅","speakerId":"avg_npc_064_weapon_1","isRemote":false,"text":"也许她应该输一场，清醒一下。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"光头马丁","speakerId":"avg_npc_107","isRemote":false,"text":"如果你真的这么想的话。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"佐菲娅","speakerId":"avg_npc_064_weapon_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"佐菲娅","speakerId":"avg_npc_064_weapon_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......哪座竞技场？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_arena_1"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"大嘴莫布","speakerId":"avg_npc_121","isRemote":false,"text":"女士们——先生们！欢迎来到炎刃竞技场，欢迎观看本日的特殊赛事——！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"大嘴莫布","speakerId":"avg_npc_121","isRemote":false,"text":"这场比赛已经引起了选拔开始以来最大规模的媒体关注，此时此刻，来自玫瑰报业集团的十二家媒体都将聚焦着这座竞技场！！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"大嘴莫布","speakerId":"avg_npc_121","isRemote":false,"text":"不仅如此——哦，我们可怜的炎刃竞技场，号称卡西米尔第三大的炎刃竞技场！今天！座无虚席！！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"大嘴莫布","speakerId":"avg_npc_121","isRemote":false,"text":"是对阵双方的人气高至如此吗？！还是这一战的确大有看点！？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"大嘴莫布","speakerId":"avg_npc_121","isRemote":false,"text":"我可以负责任地告诉大家，答案是——二者皆有！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"大嘴莫布","speakerId":"avg_npc_121","isRemote":false,"text":"这是——何等的殊荣！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"大嘴莫布","speakerId":"avg_npc_121","isRemote":false,"text":"本日特殊赛事的对战双方，一位，是来自临光家族，如今风头正盛，让狂热者们议论纷纷的美少女骑士——玛莉娅·临光！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"大嘴莫布","speakerId":"avg_npc_121","isRemote":false,"text":"而另一边——！敛藏的锋芒，千万身价，以过去的传奇骑士冠名，来自锋盔骑士团的大红人“左手”泰特斯·白杨！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"大嘴莫布","speakerId":"avg_npc_121","isRemote":false,"text":"噢噢噢！这还是第一次在骑士入场之前，奖池就已经累积到了这个数字！！看来我已经没有反复啰嗦的必要——你们早就嫌我啰嗦了对吧？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"大嘴莫布","speakerId":"avg_npc_121","isRemote":false,"text":"没问题！那么事不宜迟！有请双方骑士进入竞技场！！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"玛莉娅","speakerId":"avg_npc_061","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"大嘴莫布","speakerId":"avg_npc_121","isRemote":false,"text":"首先进入战场的是玛莉娅·临光！依旧是一身洁白甲胄！依旧是一副楚楚可怜的姿态！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"大嘴莫布","speakerId":"avg_npc_121","isRemote":false,"text":"在战胜了“塑料”瑟奇亚克至今，始终高歌猛进，在各个大小赛事都有着出色发挥的玛莉娅·临光！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"大嘴莫布","speakerId":"avg_npc_121","isRemote":false,"text":"如今登场的她，早已做出了特锦赛名额势在必得的宣言！她是否能靠这一战作为踏板，跻身卡西米尔骑士之巅？让我们拭目以待！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"玛莉娅","speakerId":"avg_npc_061","isRemote":false,"text":"（我明明没做过呀......）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"大嘴莫布","speakerId":"avg_npc_121","isRemote":false,"text":"而另一边——有请——"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"左手骑士","speakerId":"avg_npc_105","isRemote":false,"text":"闭嘴，聒噪的小丑。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"左手骑士","speakerId":"avg_npc_105","isRemote":false,"text":"你这种人根本不配站在我的赛场上，早点滚下台吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"大嘴莫布","speakerId":"avg_npc_121","isRemote":false,"text":"——没错！这就是泰特斯·白杨！我早说了，就该给选手们都装上麦克风，让所有观众沉浸在他们的厮杀之中！！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"ac13_8"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"大嘴莫布","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"本场赛事由梅什科集团，玫瑰报业联合集团，斯沃玛食品公司，呼啸守卫公司联合赞助！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"大嘴莫布","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"现场观众将随时可能获得上述公司赠予的商品优惠券！而我个人再次隆重向各位推荐观赛必备的——蓝耳牌啤酒！！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":null},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"左手骑士","speakerId":"avg_npc_105","isRemote":false,"text":"......临光。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"左手骑士","speakerId":"avg_npc_105","isRemote":false,"text":"真难看，为了保住骑士家族的地位而挣扎的样子，真像是出水的钳兽。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"左手骑士","speakerId":"avg_npc_105","isRemote":false,"text":"如果没有能力负担起骑士之名，又何必厚颜无耻地死缠烂打？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"玛莉娅","speakerId":"avg_npc_061","isRemote":false,"text":"......这不是你说了算的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"左手骑士","speakerId":"avg_npc_105","isRemote":false,"text":"无所谓，临光一家最后的骑士今天就会毁在我的手上。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"左手骑士","speakerId":"avg_npc_105","isRemote":false,"text":"放心，我和英格拉那个废物不一样......我会确实地让你知道，并非持武器者就能被叫做骑士。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"大嘴莫布","speakerId":"avg_npc_121","isRemote":false,"text":"火药味——！一触即发的火药味——！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"大嘴莫布","speakerId":"avg_npc_121","isRemote":false,"text":"就连我也不忍心继续吊大家的胃口了，让我荣幸地宣布！竞技——开始！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"玛莉娅","speakerId":"avg_npc_061","isRemote":false,"text":"——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"左手骑士","speakerId":"avg_npc_105","isRemote":false,"text":"哼。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"大嘴莫布","speakerId":"avg_npc_121","isRemote":false,"text":"——发、发生什么了！？一瞬间！开战的一瞬间！玛莉娅的剑就被打飞了！然后重重的一踢——！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"大嘴莫布","speakerId":"avg_npc_121","isRemote":false,"text":"这就是巨大的实力差距——！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"左手骑士","speakerId":"avg_npc_105","isRemote":false,"text":"把剑拿起来。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"玛莉娅","speakerId":"avg_npc_061","isRemote":false,"text":"（好、好痛......！他是怎么......！）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"左手骑士","speakerId":"avg_npc_105","isRemote":false,"text":"快点。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"玛莉娅","speakerId":"avg_npc_061","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"玛莉娅","speakerId":"avg_npc_061","isRemote":false,"text":"（枪骑兵......攻击范围很远，而且，灵活，有力.....没有漏洞。）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"玛莉娅","speakerId":"avg_npc_061","isRemote":false,"text":"......再来。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"左手骑士","speakerId":"avg_npc_105","isRemote":false,"text":"很好。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"玛莉娅","speakerId":"avg_npc_061","isRemote":false,"text":"别想得逞——！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"左手骑士","speakerId":"avg_npc_105","isRemote":false,"text":"孱弱。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"玛莉娅","speakerId":"avg_npc_061","isRemote":false,"text":"呜——！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"玛莉娅","speakerId":"avg_npc_061","isRemote":false,"text":"把光......劈开了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"左手骑士","speakerId":"avg_npc_105","isRemote":false,"text":"......很难吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"左手骑士","speakerId":"avg_npc_105","isRemote":false,"text":"本打算直接将你的剑也一分为二，哼......临光家的剑。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"左手骑士","speakerId":"avg_npc_105","isRemote":false,"text":"你握着你的信仰，可你却对它一无所知。你幼稚，无力，思想软弱，你——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"左手骑士","speakerId":"avg_npc_105","isRemote":false,"text":"不配做我的对手。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"大嘴莫布","speakerId":"avg_npc_121","isRemote":false,"text":"再一次！游刃有余的左手骑士！等着玛莉娅捡起武器，然后又是一发猛击！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"大嘴莫布","speakerId":"avg_npc_121","isRemote":false,"text":"这就是卡西米尔顶级骑士团的实力！这就是特锦赛正赛骑士的实力！第一次来到卡西米尔的观众朋友们，一刻也不要闭眼！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"大嘴莫布","speakerId":"avg_npc_121","isRemote":false,"text":"因为残酷的胜负，就在一瞬之间！！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"玛莉娅","speakerId":"avg_npc_061","isRemote":false,"text":"呃——！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_black"},{"type":"narration","text":"光芒被揉皱，摧毁，亵渎。\n在“左手”泰特斯的阴影前，玛莉娅再一次举起了剑。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":null}],"observedOperators":[]}
